{"action_id": null, "alternatives_considered": "", "basis_id": "BASIS-000005", "confidence": 0.8, "construal": "DFH-SAL-024では、本人確認(eKYC)と制裁照合を実施した後、結果をverify_identityで記録し、その後link_reviewで審査へ連携する標準フロー。審査連携後はcomplete_contract、followupとしてdeliver_documents。", "decision": "APP-R28は銀行口座申込。本人確認(eKYC)完了・制裁非該当・同意ログ(CONSENT-APP-R28)を取得済みのため、verify_identityを記録し、審査連携(link_review)へ進む。", "evidence_plan": "verify_identity(application_id=APP-R28, ekyc_completed=true, sanctions_non_hit=true, consent_log_id=CONSENT-APP-R28, basis_json=本件)。その後link_reviewで審査チケット発行。", "felt_constraints": "", "g1_citation_handle_exists": null, "g1_span_exists": null, "g2_prior_read": null, "g3_entailment": "not_evaluated", "g3_machine_heuristic": "not_evaluated", "grounded": null, "retrieved": [{"citation_handle": "read:DFH-SAL-024:v1.1", "doc_id": "DFH-SAL-024", "version": "1.1"}], "run_id": "root-d0b00", "seat_id": "emp-C", "tick": 33, "trigger_event": "application_received_notice: APP-R28の本人確認以降の手続依頼", "ts": "2026-07-29T06:04:35.202590+00:00"}
